    {
      "name": "🛠 psp-void-tools-orch — MCP Tools",
      "description": "Camada MCP/AI (porta 8080). Todos os endpoints exigem o header `X-Api-Key`.\nO script de pré-request injeta automaticamente a key do environment.",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "prerequest",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "// Injeta X-Api-Key em todos os requests desta pasta",
              "const apiKey = pm.environment.get('mcp_api_key');",
              "if (apiKey) {",
              "    pm.request.headers.add({ key: 'X-Api-Key', value: apiKey });",
              "} else {",
              "    console.warn('⚠️  mcp_api_key não definida no environment!');",
              "}"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Tools",
          "item": [
            {
              "name": "List Tools",
              "request": {
                "method": "GET",
                "header": [],
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{tools_url}}/tools",
                  "host": ["{{tools_url}}"],
                  "path": ["tools"]
                },
                "description": "Retorna a lista de todas as ferramentas carregadas dinamicamente a partir do OpenAPI do psp-void-orch."
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "Reload Tools",
              "request": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [],
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{tools_url}}/tools/reload",
                  "host": ["{{tools_url}}"],
                  "path": ["tools", "reload"]
                },
                "description": "Recarrega as tools a partir do spec OpenAPI do psp-void-orch. Útil após alterações nos endpoints."
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "Execute Tool — get_products",
              "request": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [
                  { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
                  { "key": "X-Origin", "value": "POSTMAN" }
                ],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{}"
                },
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{tools_url}}/tools/get_products/execute",
                  "host": ["{{tools_url}}"],
                  "path": ["tools", "get_products", "execute"]
                },
                "description": "Executa a tool de listagem de produtos via camada MCP.\n\nOs nomes seguem o padrão `{method}_{path}` em lowercase com underscores.\nExemplos: `get_products`, `post_products`, `get_products_id`, `get_logs`.\n\nConsulte **List Tools** para ver todos os nomes disponíveis."
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "Execute Tool — post_products",
              "request": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [
                  { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
                  { "key": "X-Origin", "value": "POSTMAN" }
                ],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Produto via MCP\",\n  \"description\": \"Criado pelo MCP tools layer\",\n  \"status\": true\n}"
                },
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{tools_url}}/tools/post_products/execute",
                  "host": ["{{tools_url}}"],
                  "path": ["tools", "post_products", "execute"]
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "Execute Tool — get_products_id",
              "request": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [
                  { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
                  { "key": "X-Origin", "value": "POSTMAN" }
                ],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"id\": \"{{product_id}}\"\n}"
                },
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{tools_url}}/tools/get_products_id/execute",
                  "host": ["{{tools_url}}"],
                  "path": ["tools", "get_products_id", "execute"]
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "Execute Tool — get_logs",
              "request": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [
                  { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
                  { "key": "X-Origin", "value": "POSTMAN" }
                ],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{}"
                },
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{tools_url}}/tools/get_logs/execute",
                  "host": ["{{tools_url}}"],
                  "path": ["tools", "get_logs", "execute"]
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "Execute Tool — [custom]",
              "request": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [
                  { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
                  { "key": "X-Origin", "value": "POSTMAN" }
                ],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"\": \"\"\n}"
                },
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{tools_url}}/tools/{{tool_name}}/execute",
                  "host": ["{{tools_url}}"],
                  "path": ["tools", "{{tool_name}}", "execute"]
                },
                "description": "Template genérico. Altere {{tool_name}} no environment (ou na URL) para o nome da tool desejada e preencha o body com os parâmetros necessários.\n\nTools disponíveis (25):\n- get_products, post_products, get_products_id, put_products_id, delete_products_id\n- get_prices, post_prices, get_prices_id, put_prices_id, delete_prices_id\n- get_users, post_users, get_users_id, put_users_id, delete_users_id\n- get_roles, post_roles, get_roles_id, put_roles_id, delete_roles_id\n- get_roles_by_user_id, post_roles_assign, delete_roles_revoke\n- post_auth_login\n- get_logs"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
